---
import Dev from '../layouts/Dev.astro';
---
<Dev title="Local workbench">
  <h1>Local workbench</h1>
  <p>Start with the source. Inspect native captures, choose a logo, or compose a social image without changing repository files.</p>
  <div class="workbench-index">
    <a href="/screenshots"><h2>Screenshots</h2><p>Native iOS and Android, paired by page and state. Original bytes and capture evidence.</p></a>
    <a href="/logos"><h2>Logos</h2><p>Canonical brand layouts, colorways and sizes. SVG and PNG originals.</p></a>
    <a href="/social"><h2>Social</h2><p>Related screens, one to four phones. Edit copy and pose; download a PNG and its recipe.</p></a>
    <a href="/"><h2>Website</h2><p>Review the public website using its selected artwork.</p></a>
  </div>
  <p class="dev-note">Local only. Source files are read at runtime; no native captures, builds or persistent social renders run here. A matching app-source fingerprint does not prove a fresh native build.</p>
  <details><summary>Geometry tools</summary><p><a href="/scenes">Orientation atlas</a> / <a href="/scenes/custom">Phone scene composer</a> / <a href="/mockups">Existing mockups</a></p></details>
</Dev>
